# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored — never commit real keys.

# Claude — reads the source, picks the warrant, writes the tag and the underline.
# Pay-as-you-go, separate from any Claude subscription. https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Tavily — web search + full-text extraction of the articles we cut from.
# Free tier is enough to test. https://app.tavily.com/home
TAVILY_API_KEY=

# ---- cost dials (both optional) ----

# Default is claude-opus-5: ~$0.50-1.00 per query, best judgment about what's
# actually worth cutting. Switch to claude-haiku-4-5 for roughly 5x cheaper
# smoke-testing — good enough to confirm the plumbing works, noticeably worse
# at deciding which passage is the warrant.
# CARD_CUTTER_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5

# How many articles each query reads. Default 8. Each one is a full-length
# model call, so halving this roughly halves the bill.
# CARD_CUTTER_SOURCE_LIMIT=3
